1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:06,320
(Howard:)A satanic fungus that looks suspiciously
like Al Pacino...

2
00:00:06,526 --> 00:00:09,896
...rises from the forest floor and says:

3
00:00:10,129 --> 00:00:11,959
"You're playing D&D...

4
00:00:12,665 --> 00:00:14,295
(Howard:)...you're playing D&D...

5
00:00:14,501 --> 00:00:16,991
(Howard:)...this whole apartment...

6
00:00:19,138 --> 00:00:20,898
...is playing D&D."

7
00:00:29,415 --> 00:00:31,815
(Penny:)Okay, who wants a drink?

8
00:00:32,018 --> 00:00:35,718
(Sheldon:)Penny, we don't consume alcohol during
Dungeons & Dragons.

9
00:00:35,889 --> 00:00:38,359
It impairs ourjudgment.

10
00:00:38,992 --> 00:00:43,022
(Penny:)Oh, this isn't alcohol.
It's a magic potion that makes me like you.

11
00:00:46,599 --> 00:00:48,399
(Leonard:)Double potion, please.

12
00:00:49,402 --> 00:00:50,422
(Howard:)Okay, here we go.

13
00:00:50,603 --> 00:00:56,443
You find yourselves face to face
with two hulking ogres.

14
00:00:56,676 --> 00:01:00,026
"What are you doing in our dungeon?"

